From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] gridcraft: the default column width follows the Normal font

ECMA-376 18.3.1.81: baseColWidth (8) characters of the Normal font digit width plus 5 px, rounded up to 8 px. New workbooks (Times New Roman 12) get 72 px; xlsx without defaultColWidth derive it from their Normal font; an explicit defaultColWidth is kept.
 crates/engine/src/cmd/print.rs  |  8 ++++----
 crates/engine/src/lib.rs        |  1 +
 crates/engine/src/tests.rs      |  1 +
 crates/model/src/lib.rs         | 12 +++++++++++
 crates/xlsx/src/sheet_read.rs   |  7 ++++---
 crates/xlsx/src/sheet_write.rs  |  4 +++-
 ...crates/xlsx/src/tests/roundtrip.rs   | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 49 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

